    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disk used",
      "description": "60 GB shared by thirteen containers, their images, the Postgres volume, seven days of Prometheus data and a week of local backups. The docker daemon's log rotation is capped for the same reason this panel exists. Selected by filesystem type rather than by mount point: in production this is the single root filesystem, and hard-coding \"/\" would leave the panel silently empty anywhere else.",
      "gridPos": {
